### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "버즈",
  "price": 170000,
  "stock": 5
}

###

### 전체 상품 조회
GET http://localhost:8081/products

###

### 상품명 조회
GET http://localhost:8081/products/에어팟

###

### 재고 추가
PATCH http://localhost:8081/admin/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### 상품 구매
POST http://localhost:8081/products/buy
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 6,
    "quantity": 2
  }
]

###

### 여러 상품 삭제
